LZMA SDK 26.06 (Igor Pavlov), public domain.
Vendored from the official 7-Zip 26.06 SDK (https://www.7-zip.org/sdk.html),
file lzma2606.7z SHA-256 1d9da340870b12712e9068be178a4436fbad785486b62aed6e2aa88ea1e3bb65
(https://github.com/ip7z/7zip/releases/download/26.06/lzma2606.7z).

The ANSI-C LZMA and LZMA2 encoder/decoder (LzmaEnc/Dec, Lzma2Enc/Dec,
7zStream), the two-thread match finder (LzFindMt, LzFindOpt, Threads),
the multithread helpers (MtCoder, MtDec), and the branch converters
(Bra.c, Bra86.c, BraIA64.c, Bra.h, RotateDefs.h) used by qze are copied
here. See lzma-sdk.txt for the license (public domain). qze also
parallelizes independent blocks.

QZip modification (2026): LzmaEnc.c / LzmaEnc.h add LzmaEnc_MemEncodePrimed
(raw LZMA with a preset dictionary, for qze's shared-window parallel blocks)
and an optional long-distance hash-table candidate in ReadMatchDistances.
Both are encoder-side only and off unless that function is called; the
stream format is standard LZMA. All other files are unmodified.
